00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.650
This most recent season
of "The Boys" has been

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.870
both chaotic and wildly compelling.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:25.020
And if Homelander's recent
antics have shown us anything,

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.940
it's that Kanye was right:

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.580
No one man should have all that power.

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:30.597
But it's not just Homelander

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:32.400
and his new radioactive daddy

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.020
