00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.310
it's all of them.

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:37.200
Whether they're as helpless as Huey

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.180
or as formidable as Starlight,

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.190
every single player is being forced

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:42.600
to play the same power game.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.580
So why are all of these characters

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:46.140
so obsessed with power,

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:47.100
and can the power struggles

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.780
in The Boys teach us something

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:50.100
about how power functions

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.660
in our own societies?

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:52.980
Let's find out with a little help

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:54.630
from some French philosophers.

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:56.548
Frenchie would be so proud of us.

00:00:56.548 --> 00:00:57.420
- (speaking foreign language)

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.887
- Welcome to this Wisecrack
edition on The Boys,

00:00:59.887 --> 00:01:02.280
"Is Power Going To Kill Us All?"

