And check out our new
stream, Wisecrack Live,

00:26:33.720 --> 00:26:34.950
taking place right here,

00:26:34.950 --> 00:26:36.540
Thursdays at 11:00 AM.

00:26:36.540 --> 00:26:39.150
Hit that like button like
you're slamming closed

00:26:39.150 --> 00:26:40.470
a copy of "Lean In,"

00:26:40.470 --> 00:26:42.810
and don't forget to ring
that bell and subscribe.

00:26:42.810 --> 00:26:44.430
As always, thanks for watching.

00:26:44.430 --> 00:26:45.263
Later.

00:26:46.132 --> 00:26:48.799
(upbeat music)

00:26:56.948 --> 00:26:59.040
But if you know someone,

00:26:59.040 --> 00:27:01.380
